WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.120
Part four: Creating Legends. It's Levy's short online orientation, and every volunteer needs the certificate on file.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:16.221
Step one. Until the certificate is in, Creating Legends shows as missing on your volunteer page.

00:00:16.421 --> 00:00:18.670
Tap Upload paperwork.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:26.120
Step two. Open the Creating Legends certificate card, and tap Take the Creating Legends training.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:32.773
Step three. The training opens on Levy's site. Enter your first and last name, and your email.

00:00:32.973 --> 00:00:34.574
Then your home location,

00:00:34.774 --> 00:00:36.460
and your group or company.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:44.670
Tap Submit, and watch the training all the way to the end. The certificate usually arrives by email within five minutes.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.361
Step four. Back on the Hub card, enter the date you completed it.

00:00:49.561 --> 00:00:53.970
Then upload the certificate, or a screenshot of it, and tap Submit.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:01:03.110
Signing the Levy packet online? Its last section takes the Creating Legends certificate too, so you can do both at once.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:09.940
Up next, part five: alcohol spots. It's optional, only if you want to work them.
